OL,3,AOasis add shows in Knebworth, Rome and
OL,4,AMunich
OL,5,
OL,6,FOasis have announced more dates for the
OL,7,Fsecond leg of their reunion tour in
OL,8,F2027.
OL,10,FThe band will now play six nights at
OL,11,FKnebworth House in Hertfordshire, the
OL,12,F125,000-capacity venue where they
OL,13,Fstaged two now legendary concerts in
OL,14,F1996.
OL,16,FThey have also added shows in Munich
OL,17,Fand Rome, while their Paris dates have
OL,18,Fbeen rescheduled because of planned
OL,19,Frailway engineering works.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
